:"October 2026 — Link button"},"5":{"id":"/docs/changelog-3","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#components","content":"Components"},"6":{"id":"/docs/changelog-4","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#october-2026--table-stripes-and-column-resize","content":"October 2026 — Table stripes and column resize"},"7":{"id":"/docs/changelog-5","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#table","content":"Table"},"8":{"id":"/docs/changelog-6","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#icons","content":"Icons"},"9":{"id":"/docs/changelog-7","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#data-tables","content":"Data tables"},"10":{"id":"/docs/changelog-8","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#september-2026--registry-on-vittaldesign","content":"September 2026 — Registry on vittal.design"},"11":{"id":"/docs/changelog-9","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#install","content":"Install"},"12":{"id":"/docs/changelog-10","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#components-1","content":"Components"},"13":{"id":"/docs/changelog-11","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#blocks","content":"Blocks"},"14":{"id":"/docs/changelog-12","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#tokens","content":"Tokens"},"15":{"id":"/docs/changelog-13","page_id":"/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/changelog#platform","content":"Platform"},"16":{"id":"/docs/changelog-14","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog","content":"This page tracks the registry-backed design system on vittal.design: components, blocks, tokens, and documentation. It does not track the legacy @fed/vital-design npm package."},"17":{"id":"/docs/changelog-15","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog","content":"That package is built from src/ and stays available for existing apps. New work ships through the registry. If you still import from the package, see the Migration Guide."},"18":{"id":"/docs/changelog-16","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog","content":"Newest entries are at the top. Headings use the month the change shipped. We only record changes that affect how you install or use the registry — new components, breaking usage, tokens, and install steps."},"19":{"id":"/docs/changelog-17","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#october-2026--react-19","content":"The registry and the docs site are developed and tested on React 19. New projects should use React 19. See Installation."},"20":{"id":"/docs/changelog-18","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#components","content":"Button: added LinkButton, a link styled as a button. It shares Button's variants, themes, and sizes, renders <a> (or a router link via render), and keeps link semantics. Use it instead of <Button nativeButton={false} render={<a />}>, which reports links as buttons. See Button → Link."},"21":{"id":"/docs/changelog-19","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#table","content":"Table can stripe body rows. striped paints even rows. striped=\"odd\" paints the other rows. Set --table-stripe and --table-row-hover on the table to change the colors."},"22":{"id":"/docs/changelog-20","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#table","content":"Reinstall the table to pick this up:"},"23":{"id":"/docs/changelog-21","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#table","content":"Breaking: hover, expanded, and selected row backgrounds no longer use bg-grayscale-opacity-100. They read --table-row-hover. With striped left off, that variable still falls back to --grayscale-opacity-100, so the default look stays the same."},"24":{"id":"/docs/changelog-22","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#table","content":"hover:bg-grayscale-opacity-100 → hover:bg-[var(--table-row-hover,var(--grayscale-opacity-100))]"},"25":{"id":"/docs/changelog-23","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#table","content":"data-[state=selected]:bg-grayscale-opacity-100 → data-[state=selected]:bg-[var(--table-row-hover,var(--grayscale-opacity-100))]"},"26":{"id":"/docs/changelog-24","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#table","content":"TableHead is now position: relative. An absolutely positioned child lines up with the header cell. If one of yours was lined up with an ancestor outside the cell, point it at the cell instead."},"27":{"id":"/docs/changelog-25","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#icons","content":"Caret up and caret down are new registry icons. See Icons."},"28":{"id":"/docs/changelog-26","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#data-tables","content":"Data Table group 01 and group 02 can resize columns. Drag the header edge. columnResizeMode defaults to onChange. Use onEnd on a wide table with many pinned columns so the columns stay put until you release."},"29":{"id":"/docs/changelog-27","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#data-tables","content":"Reinstall both blocks. Group 02 also swaps its sort icon from chevron up to the caret pair, and drops @vital-design/icon-chevron-up. @vital-design/icon-chevron-down stays for the row rail. The sort label truncates so the caret stays visible when a column gets narrow."},"30":{"id":"/docs/changelog-28","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#september-2026--registry-on-vittaldesign","content":"The documentation site and the shadcn-compatible registry now publish together at vittal.design. This entry is a snapshot of what is available today. Later entries will list only what changed."},"31":{"id":"/docs/changelog-29","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#install","content":"Add the registry, then install items with the shadcn CLI. See Installation."},"32":{"id":"/docs/changelog-30","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#install","content":"Registry URL: https://vittal.design/r/{name}.json"},"33":{"id":"/docs/changelog-31","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#components-1","content":"Foundation: Alert, Avatar, Badge, Button, Button Group, Chip, Icons, Item, Label, Separator, Skeleton, Spinner, Split Button, Tag"},"34":{"id":"/docs/changelog-32","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#components-1","content":"Inputs: Checkbox, Editable, Field, Input, Number Input, Radio Group, Search Bar, Slider, Switch, Textarea"},"35":{"id":"/docs/changelog-33","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#components-1","content":"Pickers and menus: Autocomplete, Calendar, Combobox, Command, Dropdown Menu, Popover, Select, Time Picker"},"36":{"id":"/docs/changelog-34","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#components-1","content":"Overlays and feedback: Dialog, Sheet, Toast, Tooltip"},"37":{"id":"/docs/changelog-35","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#components-1","content":"Layout and data: Card, Collapsible, Progress, Resizable, Scroll Area, Sidebar, Table, Tabs, Toolbar"},"38":{"id":"/docs/changelog-36","page_id":"/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/changelog#blocks","content":"Cloud Sidebar: flat, inline submenus, collapsible submenus, dropdown submenus, secondary nav, header